<PortfolioLayout title="Kenny Ponders" lang="zh" page="index">
<main id="main" data-screen-label="首页 · 可靠交付">
<section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">KENNY WU · AI ENGINEER · SHENZHEN</p><h1>把 AI 能力，<br>推进到<span class="blue">可靠交付。</span></h1><p class="lead">我是 Kenny，做 AI 应用与系统工程。<br>从语言处理、信息检索到多模态，让模型能力走进真实流程。</p><div class="links"><a class="primary" href="mailto:jdlow@live.cn">聊聊你的项目 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#delivery">看看交付案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><aside class="hero-aside"><img src="/assets/img/practices/walk.png" width="1254" height="1254" alt="散步中的 Kenny 插画"><p>从研究走到工程，<br>也为思考留一点空间。</p><a href="/zh/about/">关于我 ↗</a></aside></section>
<section class="delivery" id="delivery" aria-labelledby="delivery-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="label">01 / SELECTED DELIVERY</p><span class="caption">工作案例 · 职责与成果</span></div><div class="case-grid"><div class="case-copy"><p class="case-role"><time datetime="2026">2026</time> · 项目技术侧负责人</p><h2 id="delivery-title">AI 漫剧生成系统</h2><p class="case-thesis">生成之后，<br>还要能判断、能恢复。</p><p>推进剧本理解、资产解析与分镜生成协同落地，主导质量评测与验收标准建设。</p><a href="/zh/about/#experience" class="text-link">看职责与完整成果 ↗</a></div><div class="case-evidence"><div class="workflow"><div class="figure-head"><span class="label">从剧本到可验收的分镜</span><span class="caption">流程示意</span></div><ol class="flow"><li><span>01 / UNDERSTAND</span><strong>剧本理解</strong><small>拆清角色与情节</small></li><li><span>02 / ORGANIZE</span><strong>资产解析</strong><small>组织角色与场景</small></li><li><span>03 / GENERATE</span><strong>分镜生成</strong><small>结构化、多镜分解</small></li></ol><div class="quality-loop"><strong>独立质量判断</strong><span>→</span><strong>有预算的纠正</strong><span>→</span><strong>验收</strong></div><p class="recovery">运行保障：熔断 · 并发调节 · 有界恢复</p></div><div class="proof"><div><p class="proof-label">固定评测集 · 问题率</p><p class="big-number"><span class="before">≈18%</span><span class="metric-arrow">→</span>9.53%</p><p class="caption">动作过载与景别失当 · 相对降幅约 47%</p></div><div><p class="proof-label">一次真实运行</p><p class="big-number">20 <small>集</small></p><p class="caption">任务跨故障自行完成</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="support-case" aria-labelledby="rag-title"><div><p class="label">2024 / RETRIEVAL & ANSWERING</p><h2 id="rag-title">企业文档问答</h2><p>用段落层级、多路检索与动态阈值，把检索与回答接成完整流程。</p><a class="text-link" href="/zh/about/#enterprise">看这段经历 ↗</a></div><div class="rag-flow" aria-label="文档、检索、回答的流程示意"><span>文档结构</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>多路检索</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>回答评估</span></div><div class="rag-result"><strong>≈90%</strong><p>内部测试<br>召回率与问答准确率</p></div></section>
<section class="judgments" aria-labelledby="judgment-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">02 / ENGINEERING JUDGMENT</p><h2 id="judgment-title">我怎样把问题往前推进</h2></div><a href="/zh/about/#questions">反复思考的问题 ↗</a></div><div class="judgment-grid"><article><span class="number">01</span><h3>先说明，什么算做好。</h3><p>把质量问题变成可判断的指标，用固定评测集看每一次修改是否有效。</p></article><article><span class="number">02</span><h3>把失败当作流程的一部分。</h3><p>让长任务能恢复，给纠正设定预算，避免一次异常拖住整个交付。</p></article><article><span class="number">03</span><h3>让模型能力接入实际工作。</h3><p>从检索、生成到服务调度，沿着使用流程检查结果，推进到可验收。</p></article></div></section>
<section class="open-work" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">03 / OPEN-SOURCE WORK</p><h2 id="work-title">也把想法，做成可用的工具。</h2></div><a href="/zh/projects/">全部项目 ↗</a></div><div class="work-grid"><a class="work-feature" href="/zh/projects/#videowipe"><figure><img src="/assets/portfolio/focus/videowipe.jpg" alt="VideoWipe 的视频清理工作台真实截图" width="1265" height="889" loading="lazy"><figcaption>真实界面 / VideoWipe</figcaption></figure><div class="work-title"><h3>VideoWipe</h3><span>↗</span></div><p>在清晰的控制下，清理视频中的字幕与水印。</p></a><div class="work-side"><a href="/zh/projects/#script-weaver"><span class="label">SCREENPLAY · STORYBOARD</span><h3>Script-Weaver ↗</h3><p>从故事想法，走到剧本、分镜与视频提示词。</p></a><a href="/zh/projects/#obsidian-kami"><span class="label">READING · WRITING</span><h3>Kami Reader ↗</h3><p>给知识工作一个安静、顺手的阅读空间。</p></a><a href="/zh/projects/#tracework"><span class="label">CONTEXT · DECISIONS</span><h3>Tracework ↗</h3><p>让 AI 工作过程留下可回看的上下文与决定。</p></a></div></div></section>
